From 52425761ea9545cf8087080de4bf531c8c955337 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lifehealth-fresh <khaitran.160505@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 17:54:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: admin accordion, hard-delete promotions, tour covers, AI
 fallback

Admin lists expand under the selected row instead of jumping to a form at the bottom. Delete on a used promo returns 409 so staff change status via Edit. Tour lists now expose the avatar photo, and the customer home/AI pages hydrate that cover even before the list payload includes it. Recommendations auto-generate with retry and fall back to live tours when the ranking service is down.
